      "lever": "addition of alloying elements",
      "why": "The next step would be to investigate the effect of adding alloying elements, such as Cr, V, and Hf, on the properties of HEAs, particularly their mechanical properties, thermal stability, and radiation damage resistance. This could involve designing new HEA compositions and processing them using techniques such as SLM, LPBF, or SPS, and then characterizing their microstructures and properties using various experimental techniques."
